<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9022"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 6:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you have not already go to the communication board and read the last close by:lmuncy316 <BR> <BR>Then come back here.  Hopefully by the time you come to this web site and post anything you will have read the poem on poetry.com written by someone named Norman Williams.  Apparently, a Norman Williams has been taken into custody!  This may be it!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
