<!--/Post: 9061-->
<!--Post: 9068--><!--Time: 1109391150-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9068"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 8:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am nowhere near Wichita or Kansas.  If you guys have information from the guys neighbors, then I just want to say I thank God he has been caught.  Also, I believe when everything is said and done, we will learn that the majority of us was right about some things but also far from being absolutely correct.  Who knows, one of us may have really got close.  Perhaps, if we could have picked every correct detail out of every post and separate them from what was incorrect we would have got him a long time ago.  Is it true that he&#39;s head of his church? If so, give me the name of the church and what religion so I can do some research.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
